Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild working eqs libhybris against libc 2.43

Base: Droidian 99bb6098f44c5890cda0ee40d665da15dacd472e.
Keep Android 30 headers and generated GLIBC_PRIVATE bounds.
Only libhybris-common1 was installed for the Plasma upgrade. See UPGRADE-6.7.md
for build/install evidence; fresh GPU-client validation remains pending.

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+libhybris (0.0.5.53-1+droidian0+z5+git20250520205628.99bb609.next.production+eqs1~glibc243) rolling; urgency=medium
+
+  * Rebuild the pinned working source against libc 2.43 for the eqs Plasma
+    upgrade. Keep HWC/Adreno behavior and Android 30 headers unchanged.
+  * Retain generated private-ABI dependency bounds; target validation pending.
+  * Backport upstream 9b543a4 to expose the required Vulkan beta declarations.
+  * Remove the obsolete shim series entry already present in the pinned source.
+
+ -- eqs port maintainers <eqs-port@localhost>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:24:34 -0300
+
 libhybris (0.1.0+git20200424-5) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * Rebuild
diff --git a/debian/patches/series b/debian/patches/series
--- a/debian/patches/series
+++ b/debian/patches/series
@@ -1 +1 @@
-env_hybris_ld_shim_libs.patch
+vulkan-enable-beta-headers.patch
diff --git a/debian/patches/vulkan-enable-beta-headers.patch b/debian/patches/vulkan-enable-beta-headers.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/debian/patches/vulkan-enable-beta-headers.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+From 9b543a4e6e1efdb82e80bf95e1cdd000990bdf98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Alexander Rutz <alex@familyrutz.com>
+Date: Tue, 20 Jan 2026 07:07:52 -0700
+Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: enable VK_ENABLE_BETA_EXTENSIONS
+
+Fixes build failures caused by missing NV CUDA.
+error: 'vkCreateCudaModuleNV' undeclared here (not in a function); did you mean 'vkCreateCuModuleNVX'?
+---
+ hybris/vulkan/vulkan.c | 1 +
+ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
+
+diff --git a/hybris/vulkan/vulkan.c b/hybris/vulkan/vulkan.c
+index 915ece6..3648550 100644
+--- a/hybris/vulkan/vulkan.c
++++ b/hybris/vulkan/vulkan.c
+@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
+ 
+ #define VK_USE_PLATFORM_ANDROID_KHR 1
+ #define VK_USE_PLATFORM_WAYLAND_KHR 1
++#define VK_ENABLE_BETA_EXTENSIONS
+ 
+ #include <vulkan/vulkan.h>
+ #include <dlfcn.h>
+-- 
+2.55.0
+
